<SPT><TTL>Price</TTL><BRK/>
<BRK/>
<TXT>[High-Range Water-reducing Admixture (HRWA) will be priced by the<MET> liters</MET><ENG> gallons</ENG> used.][High-Range Water-reducing 
Admixture (HRWR) will be priced for payment based upon the actual volume of concrete containing the admixture 
