</SPT><SPT><TTL>Particle Shape</TTL><BRK/>
<BRK/>
<TXT>The quantity of flat and elongated particles in the separate size groups of coarse aggregate, as determined by <RID>
ASTM D4791</RID>, using a value of 3 for width-thickness ratio and length-width ratio must not exceed 25 percent in 
any size group.</TXT><BRK/>
<BRK/></SPT>
